Do you mean the bottom of the Gnomish mines of the bottom of the whole 
dungeons?
If you mean the bottom of the mines, just go down all the stairs and when 
there are no more stairs going down, you are at the bottom of the mines.
If you mean the bottom of the whole dungeons, you must first come back up 
from the mines. There is another stairway going down on the same level 
with the stairway to the mines, and that's where you can go to the deeper
levels of the Dungeons of Doom.
